. do code/pilot/manual_references/var_irf/manual_stata.do 

. * Manual reference for T21 (VAR(2) orthogonal IRF, y1 response to y2 shock, h
> =4) — Stata.
. clear all

. set more off

. 
. local data_path "code/pilot/data/pilot_v4_var.csv"

. capture confirm file "`data_path'"

. if _rc != 0 local data_path "../../data/pilot_v4_var.csv"

. import delimited "`data_path'", clear
(encoding automatically selected: ISO-8859-1)
(3 vars, 200 obs)

. 
. tsset t

Time variable: t, 1 to 200
        Delta: 1 unit

. * Fit VAR(2) with constant. Equation order y1 then y2 (so a y2 shock has no
. * contemporaneous effect on y1 under Cholesky).
. var y1 y2, lags(1/2)

Vector autoregression

